@startuml
title Master Odometry - Component Diagram

!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Master Odometry Library" {
    [Control Center] as Control
    [Data Structures] as Structs
    [Core Engine] as Engine
    [Interfaces]
    [Providers]

    package "Core Engine" {
        [Interpolation]
        [Extrapolation]
    }
}

[External Dependencies] as Ext

[Providers] ..> [Interfaces] : implements
[Providers] ..> [Engine] : uses
[Providers] ..> [Structs] : uses
[Providers] ..> [Control] : configured by

[Engine] ..> [Extrapolation] : uses
[Interfaces] ..> [Control] : uses
[Interfaces] ..> [Structs] : uses

[Providers] ..> [Ext] : uses
[Control] ..> [Ext] : uses

note right of Control
  **OdometryControl**
  Global static configuration
  and state management.
end note

note right of Structs
  **strCarOdom*_t**
  Standardized data packets
  for different sensor inputs.
end note

note right of Providers
  **OdometryLong**
  **OdometryXy**
  **OdometryVisual**
  **OdometryOrient**
  Concrete implementations for
  each data source.
end note

note right of Interfaces
  **IOdometry**
  **IOrientation**
  **OdometryBase**
  Defines the public API and
  common base functionality.
end note

note right of Interpolation
  **OdometryInterp**
  **OdomProvider**
  High-level interpolation tools.
end note

note right of Extrapolation
  **SampleExtrapolator**
  Core mathematical algorithm
  (weighted polynomial regression).
end note

note right of Ext
  **mOdom** (core kinematics)
  **sys**, **utl**, **memmgr** (utilities)
end note

@enduml
